kind: graph
semantic_diff: >-
  Base: revision 0, digest
  sha256:ca4687d250562775bab77bf8efcd27c92eddcb93bd5dd20381d59803f917a4be. Post-wave-1
  name re-diff of the graph against the final skills/ammo/SKILL.md,
  orchestration/*.md, agents/*.md, and scripts/transitions.json. Counts: 13
  nodes, 47 edges, 45 outcomes, 13 roles, 5 control nodes unchanged; checks
  30 become 31; evidence definitions 15 become 16. 10 hunks, 69 added lines
  against 27 removed; 1314 lines become 1356. Every stage, audit, gate,
  outcome token, and status name was already 1:1; the drift was in role text
  only. (1) Spawn addresses: the nine agent-backed role purposes name the
  plugin address ammo:<role> (references/harness-binding.md), for example
  ammo:ammo-auditor. (2) Stage 7b fact-check: the report writer no longer runs
  it. The lead spawns a fresh ammo-delegate as the fact-checker after the
  writer returns, with only the plugin_root line, the artifact_dir line, and
  the unchanged assignment in agents/ammo-report-writer.md, and writes
  report_assets/report_fact_check.json with ok, findings, and report_sha256
  (SKILL.md Stage 7b). Role report_fact_checker now says so;
  ammo_report_writer gains two forbidden effects (spawn the fact-checker,
  write the record); ammo_delegate names the separate fact-check seat. New
  evidence report_fact_check, produced by stage_7b_report and required by
  report_accepted. Check report_fact_check_ok keeps its evaluator and gains
  the ok:false repair loop as on_failure. New lead check
  report_fact_check_current (ok true, empty findings, report_sha256 equal to
  the current REPORT.md bytes) guards both report_accepted edges.
user_only_changes: none
plan_evidence: verified
usage_evidence: none
changelog_entry: >-
  Revision 1: role bindings name the ammo:<role> spawn address, and the
  Stage 7b fact-check is a lead-run gate recorded in report_fact_check.json.
approval: >-
  team-lead subtask, post-wave-1 re-diff (2026-10-28): fix any name drift
  against the final SKILL.md, orchestration, and agents files; update the
  report_fact_checker role and the Stage 7b text to the lead-run fact-check;
  use the ammo:<role> address where the graph names a spawn address.
